# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type | title }})

Provides a password change policy resource. Password change policies control the automated
credential rotation the Bastion performs on managed device/domain accounts: the generated
password's shape (length, character classes), the SSH key parameters used instead of a password,
and the rotation schedule.

`wallix-bastion_device`/`wallix-bastion_domain` reference a policy by name via their
`password_change_policy` attribute; this resource is what creates and manages those policies.

## Example Usage

```terraform
resource "wallix-bastion_passwordchangepolicy" "strong" {
  password_change_policy_name = "strong-rotation"
  description                 = "16 chars, all character classes required, rotated weekly"
  password_length             = 16
  lower_chars                 = 1
  upper_chars                 = 1
  digit_chars                 = 1
  special_chars               = 1
  exclude_chars               = "\"'`"
  change_period               = "@weekly"
}

# SSH key rotation instead of a password
resource "wallix-bastion_passwordchangepolicy" "ssh" {
  password_change_policy_name = "ssh-rotation"
  ssh_key_type                = "RSA"
  ssh_key_size                = 4096
}
```

